              "reasoning": {
                "text": "SGF first-week metalworking hours (travail des m\u00e9taux), the sector aircraft plants belong to. Same units as the all-industry survey, so the loading is 1 with no sector offset: their 1938 readings agree within 0.1 hours. Student-t with 4 degrees of freedom absorbs sector deviations such as the 1939 defence-work extension.\n\nStatistique g\u00e9n\u00e9rale de la France, Bulletins November 1938-December 1939, p. 9: Average weekly hours in metalworking establishments with at least 100 persons, first-week survey. [1]",
